## Thread Synchronization Model

```
                        Shared Resource: Client Context
                    ┌────────────────────────────────────┐
                    │  someip_client_ctx_t               │
                    │  ┌─────────────────────────────┐   │
                    │  │ Mutex (SemaphoreHandle_t)   │   │
                    │  └─────────────────────────────┘   │
                    │  ┌─────────────────────────────┐   │
                    │  │ Subscription Table          │   │
                    │  │  • eventgroup_id            │   │
                    │  │  • state                    │   │
                    │  │  • expiry_tick              │   │
                    │  └─────────────────────────────┘   │
                    └────────────────────────────────────┘
                                  │
            ┌─────────────────────┼─────────────────────┐
            │                     │                     │
    ┌───────▼────────┐   ┌────────▼────────┐  ┌────────▼────────┐
    │ Client RX Task │   │ Notification    │  │  TTL Manager    │
    │                │   │      Task       │  │      Task       │
    │ WRITE access:  │   │ READ access:    │  │ WRITE access:   │
    │ • Subscribe    │   │ • Check sub     │  │ • Expire subs   │
    │ • Unsubscribe  │   │   state         │  │                 │
    └────────────────┘   └─────────────────┘  └─────────────────┘
            │                     │                     │
            │ Lock Pattern        │ Lock Pattern        │ Lock Pattern
            │                     │                     │
            ▼                     ▼                     ▼
    xSemaphoreTake(             someip_client_         xSemaphoreTake(
      ctx->mutex,                 is_subscribed()        ctx->mutex,
      100ms)                       internally locks       100ms)
                                                  
    // Modify subscription                       // Mark as EXPIRED
    subscriptions[i].state =                     subscriptions[i].state =
      EVENTGROUP_SUBSCRIBED                       EVENTGROUP_EXPIRED
    
    xSemaphoreGive(                              xSemaphoreGive(
      ctx->mutex)                                  ctx->mutex)

Benefits:
• Prevents race conditions during subscription updates
• 100ms timeout prevents deadlock
• Read operations (is_subscribed) also lock for consistency
• Each client has independent mutex (no contention between clients)
```

